[VIMUME Talent OS — ADMIN MANUAL EXPORT FORMAT SCHEMA]
This file contains the configuration structure for the binary DOCX generation pipeline for systems administration.
In production, the node-docx or docx-templates library compiles this schema along with standard branding headers.

LAYOUT DESIGN SPECIFICATION:
- Page Margins: 2.5cm all around.
- Primary Typography: Outfit (Heading 1-3: Black/Gold bold, body: Charcoal/Dark gray).
- Header Branding: Productora EAR & VIMUME Talent OS official watermark.
- Sub-Tables layout: Structured tables for custom token claims payload definitions, Firestore security Rules configurations, and Web Audio API node topologies.
